<https://w3id.org/perkonto/chem> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/chem> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://w3id.org/perkonto> .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/chem> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Anonymous Author" .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/chem> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Anonymous Author" .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/chem> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Anonymous Author" .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/chem> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Anonymous Author" .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/chem> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A domain extension of PERKOnto for the professional knowledge of a computational/theoretical chemist as extractable from personal email communications. It reuses the PERKOnto communication, actor, venue and publication-lifecycle backbone and specialises the scientific layer (Dataset/Method/Metric/Task) into chemistry concepts (ChemicalSystem/ComputationalMethod/Observable/ResearchProblem) plus supporting concepts (ForceField, Software, LevelOfTheory)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/chem> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/chem> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "PERKOnto-Chem: Computational Chemistry extension of PERKOnto"@en .
<https://w3id.org/perkonto/chem> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "1.0.0" .
